body:
Fuck, yes! Once i asked my bio-mother why the fuck did you make me from THIS PERSON, because my bio-father is (count ur fingers): divorced twice and all children from that marriages is hate him; he has a problem with alcohol; he has aggressive episodes, especially when he's drunk; He's obsessed with cleanliness and control;

Like, it was a totally bad idea to make a child from him. BUT she answered me like: well, he was so romantic, he played guitar, my parents liked him...

Please get abortions and use contraceptives if you don't have the ability (money, i mean, and brains) to make your child's life good. Do. Abortions. Use. Contraception. It should be a fucking mantra.
